<title>USA: U.S. meat output 3.6 pct above a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 3.6 pct above a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, April 19, rose 3.6 at 824.8 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>19-Apr-97	480.8     6.3	 333.1     4.6	824.8</p>
<p>12-Apr-97	462.1     6.5	 323.2     4.6	796.4</p>
<p>Change:	    4.1%   -3.1%	  3.1%    0.0%	3.6%</p>
<p>20-Apr-96	482.9     6.2	 340.7     5.4	835.2</p>
<p>Change:	  - 0.4%    1.6%	 -2.2%  -14.8%     -1.2%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     7304.5   100.6	5052.3    78.8    12536.2</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     7585.7   106.6	5316.0    89.7    13098.0</p>
<p>Change:	   -3.7%   -5.6%	 -5.0%  -12.2%     -4.3%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE    CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>19-Apr-97     697,000	   30,000     1,771,000	69,000</p>
<p>12-Apr-97     669,000	   31,000     1,719,000	69,000</p>
<p>Change:	   4.2%	    -3.2%	    3.0%	  0.0%</p>
<p>20-Apr-96     699,000	   29,000     1,840,000	80,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -0.3%	     3.4%	   -3.8%	-13.8%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:  10,594,000	  478,000    26,890,000   1,188,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:* 10,770,000	  505,000    28,633,000   1,371,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.6%	    -5.5%	   -6.1%	-13.4%</p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>19-Apr-97    Est     1164	  345	    256	  133</p>
<p>12-Apr-97    Est     1165	  343	    256	  135</p>
<p>20-Apr-96    Actual  1158	  377	    255	  137</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>19-Apr-97    Est	693	  214	    189	   66</p>
<p>12-Apr-97    Est	694	  213	    189	   67</p>
<p>20-Apr-96    Actual   695	  220	    186	   68</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>05-Apr-97     47.6%	 32.5%	17.9%	  2.0%</p>
<p>06-Apr-96     49.7%	 30.2%	18.3%	  1.8%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	     SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>05-Apr-97	  96.2%		    3.1%	  0.6%</p>
<p>06-Apr-96	  95.1%		    4.1%	  0.9%</p>
<p>(1) Previous week estimates may be revised. Year ago data are actuals.</p>
<p>(2) Excludes lard.     (3) Totals may not add due to rounding.</p>
<p>1997 totals are subject to revision</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions</p>
